# QA M3 acceptance (D-064, backlog "M3 acceptance notes" 3): the Zaunerstollen
# rolling out of the open Einsiedelei is not lost in the saddle cleft. The
# qa_falkenstein_relaxed inputs up to the Z-box bump (3227, big Resi in the
# cave); she leaves the cave at once and waits under the bulge. The
# Zaunerstollen first bounces off the cave's inner wall (col 162, row 4),
# rolls back, then out of the mouth, over the H-box top, along the plateau
# and down the step at 170, and is caught in the first saddle dip (195-200,
# Gams #2): it rolls between the dip's walls (x 3120-3200) and never reaches
# the cleft at 207-209. Resi runs after it and takes it there: ExtraLife at
# 4090, 4 lives, no hurt.
